  "description": "The near misses compile: an ALLOW with ignoreCase on Ärzte only narrows (the control plane warns), a DENY under a negation only denies more, and a DENY with ignoreCase on an ASCII literal folds every spelling it reads. ÄRZTE folds to Ärzte under the ASCII fold, so the ALLOW permits it.",
